OL,5,G1415 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FBilly and Debbie hope that their
OL,7,     Ffootwear-themed pub B&B, The Shoes
OL,8,     Fin Durham, is the right fit for
OL,9,     Ftheir guests. But for one couple,
OL,10,     FThe Shoes don't fit!
OL,11,G1450 Four in a Bed
OL,12,     FJames and Annie hope that their
OL,13,     Fguests will fall for the rural
OL,14,     Fcharm of their 17th-century
OL,15,     Ffarmhouse, Biggin Hall Hotel in
OL,16,     FDerbyshire. But some of their
OL,17,     Fguests think it's a decor
OL,18,     Fdisaster.
