OL,5,G1620 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FIt's the final day of the
OL,7,     Fcompetition and the B&Bers meet
OL,8,     Ffor the last time to find out how
OL,9,     Fmuch they've been paid and to
OL,10,     Fsettle some scores, before the
OL,11,     Fwinner is announced.
OL,12,G1650 Car S.O.S
OL,13,     FPorsche 356: Tim Shaw and Fuzz
OL,14,     FTownshend fix up a 1964 Porsche
OL,15,     F356 that's in the worst state of
OL,16,     Fany car they've taken on. But
OL,17,     Funderneath all the rust lies an
OL,18,     Fautomative legend.
