OL,5,G2200 Emergency Helicopter Medics
OL,6,     FThe heli-medics race to Linda,
OL,7,     Fwho's had a heart attack on a
OL,8,     FNorfolk beach. Motocross rider
OL,9,     FAlex is hit by a bike. And
OL,10,     F15-year-old Dan is treated for a
OL,11,     Fpossible skull fracture.
OL,12,G2305 Emergency Helicopter Medics
OL,13,     FJohn is trapped in his car after a
OL,14,     Fhead-on collision on the A1, and
OL,15,     Fthe heli-medics fly to one of
OL,16,     FBritain's remotest roads to help
OL,17,     FCaroline, who's come off her
OL,18,     Fmotorbike.
